The ratio is taken only from an unfloored size of at least 9 px: a layout
that runs before the panel's size is known carries a scale factor near
zero, which the floor hides for the font and a first cut of this patch
let through (the stack 3 px from the bottom on a 640x480 guest,
2026-09-26). Two RARCH_LOG lines say what was chosen and what the
placement became, so a frame is checked against numbers.

